31\\\\n00:02:05,610 --> 00:02:08,440\\\\nPerdone, ¿me puede ayudar?\\\\n\\\\n32\\\\n00:02:09,140 --> 00:02:11,310\\\\nClaro, dígame.\\\\n\\\\n33\\\\n00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:15,255\\\\nBusco el tren para el centro.\\\\n\\\\n34\\\\n00:02:16,455 --> 00:02:19,065\\\\nSale del andén cuatro.\\\\n\\\\n35\\\\n00:02:19,765 --> 00:02:22,705\\\\n¿A qué hora sale el próximo?\\\\n\\\\n36\\\\n00:02:23,655 --> 00:02:27,530\\\\nA las diez y cuarto, pero hoy va con retraso.\\\\n\\\\n37\\\\n00:02:28,730 --> 00:02:31,725\\\\n¿Con retraso? ¿Cuánto tiempo?\\\\n\\\\n38\\\\n00:02:32,425 --> 00:02:35,640\\\\nUnos veinte minutos, más o menos.\\\\n\\\\n39\\\\n00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:39,750\\\\nVaya. Tengo una cita a las once.\\\\n\\\\n40\\\\n00:02:40,950 --> 00:02:44,440\\\\nEntonces le conviene tomar el autobús.\\\\n\\\\n41\\\\n00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:48,190\\\\n¿Está lejos de aquí la parada?\\\\n\\\\n42\\\\n00:02:49,140 --> 00:02:52,355\\\\nNo, está a cinco minutos andando.\\\\n\\\\n43\\\\n00:02:53,555 --> 00:02:57,755\\\\nSalga por la puerta principal y gire a la izquierda.\\\\n\\\\n44\\\\n00:02:58,455 --> 00:03:01,560\\\\n¿Y qué autobús tengo que coger?\\\\n\\\\n45\\\\n00:03:02,510 --> 00:03:06,165\\\\nEl treinta y dos. Pasa cada diez minutos.\\\\n\\\\n46\\\\n00:03:07,365 --> 00:03:11,236\\\\n¿Puede repetirlo, por favor? Más despacio.\\\\n\\\\n47\\\\n00:03:11,775 --> 00:03:15,155\\\\nEl treinta dos, cada diez minutos.\\\\n\\\\n48\\\\n00:03:16,105 --> 00:03:19,595\\\\nPerfecto. Gracias por su ayuda.\\\\n\\\\n49\\\\n00:03:20,795 --> 00:03:23,350\\\\nDe nada. ¡Buen viaje!\\\\n\\\\n50\\\\n00:03:24,050 --> 00:03:26,770\\\\nSeñora Ortiz? Soy Lena.\\\\n\\\\n51\\\\n00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:31,210\\\\nLo siento, llegaré un poco tarde.\\\\n\\\\n52\\\\n00:03:32,410 --> 00:03:35,845\\\\nNo pasa nada. Te espero en la entrada.\\\\n\\\\n53\\\\n00:03:36,545 --> 00:03:39,320\\\\nGracias por su paciencia.\\\\n\\\\n54\\\\n00:03:47,270 --> 00:03:50,265\\\\nPasa, pasa. Este es el salón.\\\\n\\\\n55\\\\n00:03:51,4